          "quote": "1.Interchangetworows(orcolumns).\n\n2.Multiplyeachelementinarow(orcolumn)byanon-zeronumber.\n\n3.Multiplyarow(orcolumn)byanon-zeronumberandaddtheresulttoanother\nrow(orcolumn).",
